#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/overview.rst:1
msgid "Overview of the overview docker."
msgstr "Pregled zloženega okna pregleda."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/overview.rst:11
#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/overview.rst:16
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Pregled"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/overview.rst:11
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "Krmarjenje"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/overview.rst:19
msgid ".. image:: images/dockers/Krita_Overview_Docker.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/dockers/Krita_Overview_Docker.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/overview.rst:20
msgid ""
"This docker allows you to see a full overview of your image. You can also "
"use it to navigate and zoom in and out quickly. Dragging the view-rectangle "
"allows you quickly move the view."
msgstr ""
"To zloženo okno vam omogoča, da si ogledate celoten pregled slike. Uporabite "
"ga lahko tudi za hitro krmarjenje in povečavo. Če povlečete pravokotnik "
"pogleda, lahko pogled hitro premaknete."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/overview.rst:22
msgid ""
"There are furthermore basic navigation functions: Dragging the zoom-slider "
"allows you quickly change the zoom."
msgstr ""
"Vsebuje tudi osnovne funkcije krmarjenja: vlečenje drsnika približevanja "
"omogoča hitro spremembo povečave."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/overview.rst:26
msgid ""
"Toggling the mirror button will allow you to mirror the view of the canvas "
"(but not the full image itself) and dragging the rotate slider allows you to "
"adjust the rotation of the viewport. To reset the rotation, |mouseright| the "
"slider to edit the number, and type '0'."
msgstr ""
"Preklop gumba zrcaljenja vam omogoča zrcaljenje pogleda platna (ne pa "
"celotne slike) in vlečenje drsnika vrtenja omogoča, da prilagodite vrtenje "
"pogleda. Če želite ponastaviti vrtenje, opravite |mouseright| drsnika za "
"urejanje številke in vnesite »0«."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/overview.rst:30
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Starting with version 4.4.3 the rotation can be set by manipulating the "
"angle selector, either through the circular gauge or the spin box, and can "
"be reset by double-clicking the circular gauge."
msgstr ""
"Začenši z različico 4.4.3 lahko vrtenje nastavite z manipulacijo izbirnika "
"kota, bodisi skozi krožni merilnik ali vrtilno polje, in vrednost lahko "
"ponastavite z dvoklikom krožnega merilnika."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/overview.rst:34
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "If you check the \"pin navigation controls\" button, the controls (zoom, "
#| "rotation, etc.) will always be visible. On the other hand, if the button "
#| "is unchecked, the controls will automatically hide when the mouse goes "
#| "outside the docker, and automaticaly shown when it goes over the docker."
msgid ""
"If you check the \"pin navigation controls\" button, the controls (zoom, "
"rotation, etc.) will always be visible. On the other hand, if the button is "
"unchecked, the controls will automatically hide when the mouse goes outside "
"the docker, and automatically shown when it goes over the docker."
msgstr ""
"Če potrdite gumb »pripni kontrolnike krmarjenja«, bodo kontrolniki "
"(povečava, vrtenje itn.) vedno vidni. Po drugi strani pa se kontrolniki "
"samodejno skrijejo, ko miška zapusti zloženo okno, in se samodejno "
"prikažejo, ko gre čezenj."
